---
description: Python importer conventions
globs: importer/**/*.py
alwaysApply: false
---

- Target Python 3.12 with type hints.
- Keep source retrieval, normalization, validation, and persistence separate.
- Make every import idempotent and safe to retry.
- Use fixture data in tests; tests must not depend on live NBA endpoints.
- Record rejected records explicitly rather than silently dropping them.
- Never print secrets or database connection strings.
